    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BRANT & CO Property Consultants are delighted to present 4 Laurelton, Swords to the market, a spacious four-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home offering generous living accommodation, off-street parking and a particularly good-sized rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe property offers excellent potential for purchasers looking to put their own stamp on a substantial family home. While some modernisation would further enhance the property, the generous proportions, practical layout and established residential location make this a very attractive opportunity.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation is bright and spacious, with a welcoming entrance hallway leading through to the main living room, which features timber-style flooring and an attractive feature fireplace. Double doors open through to a separate dining/family room, providing excellent additional living space and a flexible layout for family life.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a generous kitchen and dining area with a good range of fitted units and ample space for everyday dining. Large sliding patio doors provide plenty of natural light and direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nA particularly useful feature of the property is the additional ground-floor WC/utility area, while upstairs the accommodation comprises four bedrooms, including a generously proportioned main bedroom with fitted wardrobes. There is also a family bathroom and additional shower facilities.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front. To the rear is a large private garden, predominantly laid in lawn and bordered by mature boundaries, with a timber garden shed. The size of the garden provides excellent outdoor space for children, entertaining or landscaping and may also offer scope for further enhancement or extension, subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\n4 Laurelton enjoys a convenient Swords location within easy reach of local schools, shops, sporting facilities and everyday amenities. Swords Village and the Pavilions Shopping Centre are readily accessible, together with Dublin Airport and excellent transport links including the M1, M50 and regular bus services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its four-bedroom accommodation, generous living space and excellent rear garden, this property represents a great opportunity for families, first-time buyers or purchasers looking for a home they can modernise to their own taste.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\nFour-bedroom semi-detached family home\r\nThree bathrooms/WCs\r\nGenerous living accommodation\r\nSeparate living and dining/family areas\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nSpacious kitchen/dining area\r\nSliding doors leading directly to the rear garden\r\nGround-floor utility/WC\r\nGenerous main bedroom with fitted wardrobes\r\nGood-sized private rear garden\r\nTimber garden shed\r\nOff-street parking\r\nExcellent potential to modernise and personalise\r\nPotential to extend, subject to planning permission\r\nConvenient Swords location\r\nEasy access to Dublin Airport, M1 and M50\r\nClose to schools, shops and local amenities\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through BRANT & CO Property Consultants."
      },
